==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|el}} [[κόσμος]] (''[[cosmos]]'') meaning [[world]], and [[πόλις]] (''[[polis]]'') meaning [[city]], [[people]], [[citizenry]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/kɒz.mə(ʊ)ˈpɒl.ɪ.tən/}}, {{SAMPA|/kQz.m@(U)"pQl.I.t@n/}}
